"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 9.598,
"text": "Before dawn, Russian tanks cross into Estonia and Latvia. Swarms of drones fly ahead of them. A second force pushes into Lithuania from Belarus.",
"end": 9.873
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 9.873,
"vo_start": 10.148,
"vo_end": 19.208,
"text": "Within hours, NATO invokes Article 5. An attack on one member is an attack on all of them. Now the whole alliance is at war.",
"end": 19.483
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 19.483,
"vo_start": 19.758,
"vo_end": 28.155,
"text": "This is a made-up scenario, built from real war games and NATO assessments. But it shows the race that would decide everything: how fast can NATO get to the front?",
"end": 29.105
}
],
